    "detailed_description": "Embark on your Dream Adventure: Discover uncharted lands, master the waves, and soar the skies! <br><br>Whale Captain is a challenging shoot-em-up bullet dodging game with a dash of side scrolling platformer:<br><br>\u2022 Crate smashing, power-ups, and coin collecting (x100 coins =\u00a0x1 \u2661).<br><br>\u2022 Six unique maps \u2014 Randomly ordered, each with two phases, and becoming progressively more difficult as the journey unfolds.<br><br>\u2022 Randomized enemy and obstacle generation system, no adventure is exactly the same.<br><br>\u2022 Mid-level intermissions in the form of bonus mini-games to collect more coins and make repairs, go for gold!<br><br>\u2022 Each map ends in a climactic Epic Multi-Phase Boss Battle.<br><br>\u2022 End-of-level loot to enhance the ship\u2019s arsenal of abilities, with well over a dozen to discover.<br><br>\u2022 Progression is recorded at the end of each map (and also saved on Steam Cloud), but be warned \u2014 losing all your \u2661 means beginning the journey anew.<br><br>Do you possess the unwavering resolve, relentless determination, and burning desire to be Whale Captain?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL AND DIFFICULTY OPTIONS</h2><br>\u2022 Gamepad Support: Use the Left Trigger Button for more precision. Toggling the Thumbs Up Button in the settings panel adjusts the maximum sensitivity.<br><br>\u2022 Keyboard/Mouse Support: Use the Thumbs Up Button in the settings panel to select whether movement is an absolute distance from the cursor or relative to the cursor.<br><br>\u2022 Difficulty selection: Use the Clock Button in the settings panel to slow down time for a more leisurely and relaxed experience.",
